  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Evaluate $|x-5|-|3-x|+2$ for $x=8.$",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=8$ and then evaluate the absolute values before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|x-5|-|3-x|+2 & = \\\\ |8-5|-|3-8|+2 & = \\\\ |3|-|-5|+2 & = \\\\ 3-5+2 & = \\\\ 0 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
